{
 "vak": "Wiskunde basis",
 "titel": "Bedrijfswetenschappen: afgeleiden berekenen met rekenregels",
 "onder": "Afgeleiden berekenen zonder limiet: de basisafgeleiden, de rekenregels en de kettingregel.",
 "secties": [
  {
   "kop": "Notatie en basisafgeleiden",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "De afgeleide van \\(y=f(x)\\) noteer je \\(f^{\\prime}(x)\\) of, met de notatie van Leibniz, \\(\\dfrac{dy}{dx}\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(f(x)\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(f^{\\prime}(x)\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">voorbeeld</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(c\\) (constante)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(0\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((5)^{\\prime}=0\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(x^{n}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(n\\cdot x^{n-1}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((x^{5})^{\\prime}=5x^{4}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{1}{x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(-\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\left(\\dfrac{4}{x^{2}}\\right)^{\\prime}=(4x^{-2})^{\\prime}=-\\dfrac{8}{x^{3}}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\sqrt{x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(e^{x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(e^{x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(a^{x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(a^{x}\\ln a\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((2^{x})^{\\prime}=2^{x}\\ln 2\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\ln x\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{1}{x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\log_{a}x\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{1}{x\\ln a}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((\\log x)^{\\prime}=\\dfrac{1}{x\\ln 10}\\)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "Let op: \\(x^{2}\\) (veranderlijke in het grondtal) en \\(2^{x}\\) (veranderlijke in de exponent) volgen <strong>niet</strong> dezelfde regel."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Som, veelvoud, product en quotiënt",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">regel</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">formule</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">som</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((f+g)^{\\prime}=f^{\\prime}+g^{\\prime}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">veelvoud</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((c\\cdot f)^{\\prime}=c\\cdot f^{\\prime}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">productregel</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((f\\cdot g)^{\\prime}=f^{\\prime}\\cdot g+f\\cdot g^{\\prime}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">quotiëntregel</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\left(\\dfrac{f}{g}\\right)^{\\prime}=\\dfrac{f^{\\prime}g-fg^{\\prime}}{g^{2}}\\)</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "De afgeleide van een product is dus <strong>niet</strong> \\(f^{\\prime}\\cdot g^{\\prime}\\). Bij de quotiëntregel is de volgorde in de teller belangrijk: eerst \\(f^{\\prime}g\\), dan min \\(fg^{\\prime}\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<ul><li>\\((3x^{4}-2x^{2}+7x-1)^{\\prime}=12x^{3}-4x+7\\); \\((x^{2}+x^{3})^{\\prime}=2x+3x^{2}\\)</li><li>\\(f(x)=x^{3}-4x\\): \\(f^{\\prime}(x)=3x^{2}-4\\), dus \\(f^{\\prime}(2)=8\\)</li><li>\\(\\big((2x+1)(x^{2}-3)\\big)^{\\prime}=2(x^{2}-3)+(2x+1)\\cdot 2x=6x^{2}+2x-6\\)</li><li>\\((x\\cdot e^{x})^{\\prime}=e^{x}+xe^{x}=(x+1)e^{x}\\)</li><li>\\(\\left(\\dfrac{x}{x+1}\\right)^{\\prime}=\\dfrac{1\\cdot(x+1)-x\\cdot 1}{(x+1)^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{(x+1)^{2}}\\)</li><li>\\(\\left(\\dfrac{2x-1}{x}\\right)^{\\prime}=\\dfrac{2x-(2x-1)}{x^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{x^{2}}\\), dus \\(f^{\\prime}(1)=1\\)</li><li>\\(\\left(\\dfrac{e^{x}}{x}\\right)^{\\prime}=\\dfrac{e^{x}x-e^{x}}{x^{2}}=\\dfrac{(x-1)e^{x}}{x^{2}}\\)</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "De kettingregel",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<p style='text-align:center'><strong>\\(\\big(f(g(x))\\big)^{\\prime}=f^{\\prime}(g(x))\\cdot g^{\\prime}(x)\\)</strong></p><p style='text-align:center'>buitenste functie afleiden, binnenste laten staan, en vermenigvuldigen met de afgeleide van de binnenste</p>"
    },
    {
     "soort": "kader",
     "html": "<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;text-align:left;\"><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(f(x)\\)</th><th style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;background:rgba(47,93,80,.09);padding:6px 9px;color:#234539;font-weight:600;text-align:left;\">\\(f^{\\prime}(x)\\)</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((3x-2)^{4}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(4(3x-2)^{3}\\cdot 3=12(3x-2)^{3}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\((x^{2}+1)^{3}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(3(x^{2}+1)^{2}\\cdot 2x=6x(x^{2}+1)^{2}\\), niet enkel \\(3(x^{2}+1)^{2}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(e^{3x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(3e^{3x}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(e^{2x}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(2e^{2x}\\), dus \\(f^{\\prime}(0)=2\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\ln(x^{2}+4)\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{2x}{x^{2}+4}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\ln(3x)\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{3}{3x}=\\dfrac{1}{x}\\), dus \\(f^{\\prime}(2)=\\frac{1}{2}\\)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\sqrt{2x+5}\\)</td><td style=\"border:1px solid #e4ded0;padding:6px 9px;color:#23291f;\">\\(\\dfrac{1}{2\\sqrt{2x+5}}\\cdot 2=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{2x+5}}\\)</td></tr></table>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "kop": "Raaklijn en betekenis",
   "blokken": [
    {
     "soort": "tekst",
     "html": "De raaklijn in \\((a,f(a))\\): <strong>\\(y-f(a)=f^{\\prime}(a)(x-a)\\)</strong>. Voor \\(y=x^{2}\\) in \\((3,9)\\): \\(f^{\\prime}(3)=6\\), dus \\(y-9=6(x-3)\\) of \\(y=6x-9\\)."
    },
    {
     "soort": "figuur",
